WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:03.045
I got a lot of things to do,

00:00:03.504 --> 00:00:05.923
and I need my memory to do it.

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:11.678
Reggie, I'm old,

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:14.473
and I seem like I can't remember
nothing no more.

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:17.017
I try to say what day it is.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.269
I ain't got a clue.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:22.105
Hey!

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:23.440
-Coy!
-A car--

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.569
What you doing, Unc?

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.030
So, you want me to take you
to that special doctor?

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:32.449
One that might could help you
remember things.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:36.787
Is Reggie coming later?

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:38.497
No, it's just you and me.

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:41.041
But Reggie did want you
to go see this doctor, so...

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:43.585
We developed a treatment.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:48.006
Mr. Grey will remember everything
that he has ever known.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.884
But the treatment will only work once.

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:52.511
Is that what you want?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.055
I got a lot of things to do,

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:59.309
and I need my memory to do it.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.068
Mr. Grey!
How you feeling?

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:09.945
Never better. And that's a fact.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.950
I can see it all so clear now.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:21.915
My mind... there's a whole lifetime
just spinning around in there.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:25.836
My uncle Coydog stole something.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.588
Treasure.

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:29.339
I'm gonna find it.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.801
Papa Grey, I'm worried about you.

00:01:32.885 --> 00:01:35.512
The rate of the decline is accelerating.

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:38.056
Meaning my mind gonna be
worse than it was before?

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.894
But I got to finish this.

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.693
You got to let the river take its course.

00:01:52.196 --> 00:01:54.531
And the river know
right where it's going. 

